        },
        {
          "text": "’Dini ’ba ’wara Israelini ’diyi dria eca opi vu Hebironia; te opi Daudi eri azi e’yo aziza yi be Hebironia Yehova ma milia, yi osu odu Daudi ma dria eri ’bazu opiru Israeli ma drilia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
